#   3. Right-click the ClientHello packet → Copy → "...as Hex Stream"
#   4. Paste the hex bytes below (whitespace and comments are ignored)
#
# TODO: Replace this placeholder with actual captured hex bytes.
# The hex should start with "16 03 01" (TLS Record Header).
#
# Key Firefox differences vs Chrome:
#   - Different cipher suite order
#   - record_size_limit extension present
#   - delegated_credentials extension present
#   - No ALPS extension
#   - Different GREASE behavior
